MACRO P                                                                         
 &P.W6115A01                                            1    34 A               
*                                 LEAD TIME DATA FOR INBOUND PER                
*                                 PLACEMENT IN DIFFERENT IDDC                   
*                                 AIM TIMES FOR WORKFLOW                        
     &P.IDDC                                            1     2 A               
*                                 WAREHOUSE IDENTIFIER                          
     &P.KDINLUPF                                        3     4 A               
*                                 FOLLOW-UP STATUS RECEIVING                    
     &P.KVTID-NORM                                      7     4 N               
*                                 NORMAL AIM TIME FOR AN ADDRESS                
     &P.KVTID-PRIO                                     11     4 N               
*                                 PRIO AIM TIME WORKFLOW/ADDRESS                
     &P.FLEXCP                                         15     1 A               
*                                 GENERAL FLAG FOR EXCEPTION                    
     &P.IDLEVNR                                        16     5 A               
*                                 SUPPLIER NUMBER (VENDOR NUMBER)               
     &P.IDAVD-DAG                                      21     5 A               
*                                 DEPARTMENT OF EMPLOYED/DAY                    
     &P.IDGRUPP-DAG                                    26     2 A               
*                                 TEAM ID OF EMPLOYED/DAY                       
     &P.IDAVD-NATT                                     28     5 A               
*                                 DEPARTMENT OF EMPLOYED/NIGHT                  
     &P.IDGRUPP-NATT                                   33     2 A               
*                                 TEAM ID OF EMPLOYED/NIGHT                     
*** END COPY                             LENGTH =            34                 
